Visibility model used across sites: **PUBLIC** (anyone, subject to instance anonymous policy), **PROTECTED** (authenticated users), **PRIVATE** (creator; admins/super-users in some paths). MCP/Connect/gRPC-Gateway all delegate to the same handlers below — no separate enforcement layer.

---

### 1. Memo RPC API — single-memo read (`GetMemo`)
**File:** `/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go`

Central gate: `checkMemoReadAccess` (lines 39–68), called from `GetMemo` (356–368).

```39:68:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go
